<div id="ViEtDeVdIvId" style="POSITION:Relative;FONT-FAMILY:Arial;FONT-SIZE:12px; BACKGROUND-COLOR:white"><div style="font-size: 12px;"><br></div><div style=""><p style="line-height: normal; margin: 0pt 0in; text-indent: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2">The Department of ENT and Head &amp; Neck Surgery at NRCH is dedicated to providing advanced care for a wide range of Ear, Nose, Throat, and Head &amp; Neck conditions. </font></span></p><p style="line-height: normal; margin: 0pt 0in; text-indent: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><br></font></span></p>  <p style="line-height: normal; margin: 0pt 0in; text-indent: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"="">The OPD offers a robust array of diagnostic and treatment options, including endoscopic evaluations, minor surgical procedures, and specialized care for vertigo and hearing disorders. </span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">N</span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"="">ewborn</span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""> hearing screenings, Audiometry, and hearing aid solutions are available.</span></font></p><p style="line-height: normal; margin: 0pt 0in; text-indent: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""><br></span></font></p>          <p style="line-height: normal; margin: 0pt 0in; text-indent: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2">A fully equipped Minor OT enables the team to perform procedures such as biopsies, abscess drainage, and foreign body removal.&nbsp;</font></span><span trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"="" style="font-size: small; text-indent: 0in;">The department is well-equipped with the latest technology and provide a broad range of surgical interventions</span><span trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="" style="font-size: small; text-indent: 0in;"> which </span><span trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"="" style="font-size: small; text-indent: 0in;">include microscopic and endoscopic ear surgeries to treat chronic infections and improve hearing, as well as nasal &amp; sinus surgeries for conditions like sinusitis and nasal tumors.&nbsp;</span></p><p style="line-height: normal; margin: 0pt 0in; text-indent: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""><br></span></font></p><p style="line-height: normal; margin: 0pt 0in; text-indent: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""><img src="https://nr.indianrailways.gov.in//uploads/images/1761040853558-Picture9.png"><br></span></font></p><p style="line-height: normal; margin: 0pt 0in; text-indent: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><br></font></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2">They also specialize in throat and vocal cord surgeries, offering expert care for voice disorders and airway obstructions.&nbsp;</font></span><span style="font-size: small;">Head and neck cancer surgeries are performed with precision, ensuring comprehensive management of tumors while prioritizing oncological and functional outcomes.</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-size: small;"><br></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2">The department has successfully performed over 15 cochlear implant surgeries &amp; offers bone conduction implants for specialized cases, transforming the lives of patients with hearing loss.&nbsp;</font></span><span style="font-size: small;">With a skilled team, and a compassionate approach, the ENT Department of NRCH delivers seamless, high-quality care for all conditions under one roof.</span></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2">Whether addressing routine ailments or performing life-changing surgeries, they are committed to making every patient’s journey towards better health successful and fulfilling. </font></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><br></font></span></p><p style="line-height: normal; margin: 0pt 0in; text-indent: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-variant-numeric:="" normal;="" font-variant-east-asian:="" font-variant-alternates:="" font-variant-position:="" font-variant-emoji:="" letter-spacing:="" 0pt;="" font-weight:="" bold;="" vertical-align:="" baseline;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2">                 </font></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><img src="https://nr.indianrailways.gov.in//uploads/images/1761040951867-Picture10.png" style="font-size: small;"></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><br></font></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 176,="" 80);="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><b>Dr. Divya Aggarwal</b> </span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">has been heading the ENT Department for the past 10 years. An alumnus of NRS Medical College, Kolkata (MBBS, 1992), he earned his DLO from the University College of Medicine, Kolkata, in 1997&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">and completed his DNB in ENT from Sir Ganga Ram Hospital, New Delhi, in 2010. He has done a certification course on Cochlear implants from University of Miami, USA. His expertise includes ear surgeries, endoscopic sinus surgeries, laryngeal laser surgeries, cochlear implants, and bone conduction hearing implants. A faculty and examiner for postgraduate ENT DNB courses, he has also served as Treasurer of Delhi AOI and the All-India Rhinology Society. Currently, he is on the editorial board of Clinical Rhinology – An International Journal.</span></font></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><br></font></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 176,="" 80);="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><b>Dr. Shruti </b></span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 176,="" 80);="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><b>Ogra</b>&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">completed her MBBS from Government Medical College, Kottayam, Kerala &amp; MS in ENT from King George’s Medical University, Lucknow, in 2006, with a distinction award. She has authored a chapter on Mucormycosis, serves as a faculty for temporal bone dissection workshops and honed her skills in Cochlear implantation from AIIMS, Delhi last year. With 17 years of experience, she has been performing endoscopic ear surgeries along with a wide range of routine ENT procedures.</span></font></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><br></font></span></p><p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; margin-left: 0in; direction: ltr; unicode-bidi: embed; word-break: normal;"><font class="font_12px" style="color:black;" size="2"><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" color:="" rgb(0,="" 176,="" 80);="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""><b>Dr. Divya Gupta </b></span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">is an alumna of Lady </span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">Hardinge</span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"=""> Medical College, New Delhi with gold medals in MBBS. She completed her postgraduate training in ENT with an MS and DNB in 2012, earning a distinction award from Maulana Azad Medical College, Delhi. She underwent three years of Senior residency at the same institution. Dr. Gupta holds an MRCS in ENT from the Royal College of Surgeons, Glasgow. She has advanced her expertise in Rhinology and Skull Base Surgery at Stanford Medical University, California and holds a certification in vertigo management.&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: " trebuchet="" ms";="" font-weight:="" bold;"="">In 2023, she was honored with International Visiting Scholar Award by American Academy of Otolaryngology and Head &amp; Neck Surgery. Her clinical focus spans a wide range of ENT and head and neck conditions, and she has published over 30 articles in national and international journals.</span></font></p></div><div style="font-size: 12px;"><br></div><div style="font-size: 12px;"><br></div><span style="font-size: 12px;"><img src="https://nr.indianrailways.gov.in//uploads/images/1754473099952-ENT Schedule.png"></span><br></div>
